        <mxCell id="title" value="Currynomics Extended T-DM / DAOMod ERD — provisional first draft for Sowelu review" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="20" width="2800" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Status:&lt;/b&gt; editable review draft, not validated case evidence. Exact Goal parallelogram and Quality Goal cloud styles follow available diagrams.net sources. Other glyph choices are provisional because the thesis text extraction does not preserve all icons.&lt;br&gt;Solid black = decomposition; dashed blue = association. Gray header = on-chain; yellow header = snapshot/hybrid; no overlay = off-chain. Full triggers, pre/postconditions, agents, and XSD-valid references are in Currynomics_ET-DM.model.xml." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="80" width="4300" height="105" as="geometry"/></mxCell>

